animated Hayate. Still shaken by her lover’s unexpected return as an enemy, Yugao manages to catch up to Hayate and his men.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-04-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":7.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5YuPKF9WGwAY7IpMelhW5ICcutX.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5YuPKF9WGwAY7IpMelhW5ICcutX.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31910/season/14/episode/308"},{"id":"1142338","seasonNumber":14,"episodeNumber":309,"title":{"value":"Missione di grado A: la competizione","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Naruto arrives to help a team of Allied Shinobi Forces led by Karui, who are struggling against a reanimated samurai. Naruto recognizes the samurai as Tatewaki, a man he met during a past mission.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-04-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":7.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tkMBETffUQVfgjxKiEZLDva9M8Z.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tkMBETffUQVfgjxKiEZLDva9M8Z.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31910/season/14/episode/309"},{"id":"1142341","seasonNumber":14,"episodeNumber":310,"title":{"value":"La caduta del castello","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Leaf Shinobi succeed in bringing young lord Shu into custody, placing a disguised Naruto as his double. But Tatewaki soon uncovers Naruto’s identity and surrounds the intruder with his men.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-04-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":7.3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/558X65ARUmCIzApqnFxNI2ZadcY.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/558X65ARUmCIzApqnFxNI2ZadcY.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31910/season/14/episode/310"},{"id":"1142348","seasonNumber":14,"episodeNumber":311,"title":{"value":"I veri amici","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Madara is prepping his new jutsu Limited Tsukuyomi, choosing Naruto as his test subject. Meanwhile, Naruto is spending his day off alone in his room. Thinking that Naruto is lonely, Lee suggests they all go to the bathhouse for some relaxation.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-05-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":7.6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nrmNDkKHtIfWRb43NzTfehgQlLH.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nrmNDkKHtIfWRb43NzTfehgQlLH.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31910/season/14/episode/311"},{"id":"1142349","seasonNumber":14,"episodeNumber":312,"title":{"value":"Il vecchio maestro e l'occhio del drago","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Might Guy arrives on the battlefield to stop a Reanimated Shinobi who he recognizes as Master Chen, the legendary Taijutsu User from the Third Great Ninja War.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-05-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":7.2,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kn4noH7vsFTvOWNhC81sip0OfzE.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kn4noH7vsFTvOWNhC81sip0OfzE.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31910/season/14/episode/312"},{"id":"1142353","seasonNumber":14,"episodeNumber":313,"title":{"value":"Pioggia seguita da neve, con qualche fulmine","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A reanimated boy who can control weather appears before Team Ino-Shika-Cho, Sakura, and Kiba, who are all fighting in different locations. To their surprise, the boy seems to know them.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-05-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":6.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eC3lcqbgMCwpgsoER1ac9fZzuLo.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eC3lcqbgMCwpgsoER1ac9fZzuLo.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31910/season/14/episode/313"},{"id":"1142361","seasonNumber":14,"episodeNumber":314,"title":{"value":"La triste pioggia di sole","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The weather-controlling enemy is revealed to be Yota, a boy who came to the Leaf Village years ago and befriended the local kids, including Naruto.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-05-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":7.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bx0Lq6Trgx1p0QH9Y9rrt9K4PFu.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bx0Lq6Trgx1p0QH9Y9rrt9K4PFu.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31910/season/14/episode/314"},{"id":"1142362","seasonNumber":14,"episodeNumber":315,"title":{"value":"La storia di Yota","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Naruto and the others finally regain their lost memories regarding Yota. Years ago, the Leaf Village kids came to befriend Yota, but the adults believed the young boy was a spy and took him away for questioning.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-05-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":7.6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5wzEmYEO1NLCvbGcB1G4CvKdrAE.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5wzEmYEO1NLCvbGcB1G4CvKdrAE.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31910/season/14/episode/315"},{"id":"1142366","seasonNumber":14,"episodeNumber":316,"title":{"value":"La resurrezione dell'esercito alleato","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kabuto reanimates an army of unknown shinobi led by Danzo’s former bodyguard Torune to retrieve the ones he lost to the Allied Forces. But aside from Torune, the reanimated shinobi are all weak and are quickly sealed away.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-06-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":7.2,